OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with early mist or fog
OL,6,Fin the glens. A mostly dry day with
OL,7,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Funtil cloud spreads south later,
OL,9,Ffollowed by showery rain along
OL,10,Fnorthern coasts towards the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showery rain,
OL,13,Fmostly in the north. Drier with clear
OL,14,Fspells south. Becoming mostly dry and
OL,15,Ffrosty with clear spells after
OL,16,Fmidnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FMostly dry and bright but
OL,19,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,20,Fshowers spread south from the late
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
